@node Top
@top CoreUtils

@code{CoreUtils} is an independent collection of Unix-like command-line
utilities written in Zig 0.17.0.  It is developed by HiMitsu and distributed
under the MIT License.

@strong{CoreUtils is not GNU Coreutils.}  It is not affiliated with, endorsed
by, or part of the GNU Project or the GNU Coreutils package.  It is a separate
project with its own identity, goals, and design.  It does not claim full
compatibility with GNU Coreutils or with any POSIX utility specification.

This manual documents every utility that is actually implemented in the
project, the options that the source code accepts, verified behavior, and the
known limitations of each program.

